---
import SectionHeading from '@/components/ui/SectionHeading.astro';
---

<section id="about" class="scroll-mt-16 px-6 py-20 sm:px-10 lg:py-28 max-w-2xl">
  <SectionHeading index="01" title="About" />

  <div class="space-y-5 text-fg-muted leading-relaxed">
    <p>
      I'm Sameer Zaheer, an AI/ML engineering leader with 12+ years of experience, currently
      consulting independently as <strong class="text-fg font-medium">AutomateThis</strong>.
      I am currently the CTO of Actuality.live, where I have productionized the app from a 
      prototype to a platform for 200+ daily users, with >99%+ uptime. Our work was 
      got the company into the Google for Startups Accelerator.
      Before that, I led the wakeuphrase team at SoundHound optimizing edge inference,
      and worked as a Forward Deployed Engineer at Palantir building directly
      on the Foundry platform. I hold 4 patents.
    </p>
    <p>
      I now take on production AI/ML projects end-to-end to achieve robust outcomes.
    </p>
    <p class="pt-3 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-fg-subtle">
      The Team
    </p>
    <p>
      Alongside me, AutomateThis's team has hands-on experience across AI
      agents, full-stack application development, computer vision, and
      production ML. We also partner with other consulting firms.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
